==Description==
'''Hardcore Lobby''' was a lobby which functioned similarly to the [[Main Lobby]], however, rather than housing survival [[Elevators]], its [[Elevators]] would be used to start [[Hardcore Mode|Hardcore]] matches.

It contained a few [[Elevators]], [[Leaderboard]]s and a crate opening area.

==Appearance==
The '''Hardcore Lobby''' was located on a few black platforms with neon lights. One giant platform had a purple ball and a portal to the [[Main Lobby]]. Stairs lead to three other portions of the map, first being a small are containing [[Leaderboard]]s and purple buttons that did nothing, but could be pressed. On the opposite end there was a crate opening area. The middle area is the spot where all the [[Elevators]] are located. They are all for [[Hardcore Mode|Hardcore]] mode, meaning they go through a set of maps specific to that mode.

